				+ "|weapon1={{plink|Soulreaper axe}} / {{plink|Scythe of Vitur}}|weapon2={{plink|Ghrazi rapier}} / {{plink|Blade of Saeldor}}{{efn|On the stab attack style.|name=stab}}}}\n"
